# Read at deploy time by the infra repo (terraform-modules/github_env_file) and merged into
# the mpp-frontend-env ConfigMap. Non-secret values only: this repo is public.
# See frontend/README.md for the full contract.
#
# No keys yet, but the file must exist: the staging unit reads it on every apply.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL is baked into the image at build time by .env.build.<dev|staging|prod>.
# PORT is Terraform's, not ours.
